{"3942780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cute the Baldy and the Fluffy", "steam_appid": 3942780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time in the old wild wild wild wild wild wild west... <br>There was a gang that struck fear into the innocent heart of good people (or rather, animals). The bosses of this terrible gang were known as &quot;The Cute, the Baldy and the Fluffy&quot;. Terrifying names, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day took over an entire town, got rid of the sheriff, and declared themselves the owners of the place! But they didn't know that a very famous vigilante lived there, McDog Jeremya! They didn't have a idea of what was expecting for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To finish and/or complete this game it'll probably take around 2/3 hours in most cases, but if you are experienced in this genre, it's possible to finish it in around 1 hour. Also using a controller is highly recommended to playing this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  <br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 4 different biomes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 bosses to face;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulty levels (can be changed at any time);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old wild west inspired themes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute 2D pixelated graphics set on a 3D world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of different Items to find;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified experience level system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative paths.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time in the old wild wild wild wild wild wild west... <br>There was a gang that struck fear into the innocent heart of goo